<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM WINS PLN 18.8 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM WINS PLN 18.8 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA signed a 18.8 million zloty contract to finish part of a hospital in the central city of Radom, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said work on the project  had to be completed by April 30, 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
